{%- comment -%}
  fye-ring-finder — the step-by-step ring finder. 1 use: page.find-your-ring.

  REVISED 03/09/2026 (Ed): the last step no longer ends on a button. As soon as
  the final question is answered the matching rings appear in place, fetched
  from templates/collection.fye-finder.liquid (a `layout none` fragment of the
  real collection, so Shopify's native filters do the work). Beside them sits
  the custom-options enquiry, because the shopper who did not find their ring
  is exactly the one worth talking to.

  HOW IT WORKS
  · Three JOURNEY blocks (a collection each) and one STEP block per question.
    A step belongs to a journey by matching `journey` keys. Steps render in
    block order, all present in the HTML and hidden; fye-ui.js shows one at a
    time and appends a filter param per answer.
  · Options are a textarea, one per line: `Label | value | icon.svg`.
    Value and icon are optional; a missing value falls back to the label.
    One block per option would need ~70 blocks and Shopify caps a section at
    50, so the textarea IS the editable list.
  · VALUE SYNTAX, read by fye-ui.js:
      Concave                       filter.p.m.filters.<param>=Concave
      1.00..1.49                    <param>.gte=1.00&<param>.lte=1.49  (either side may be empty)
      carat=18ct&metal_colour=Rose Gold   two params at once; the step's own
                                    param is ignored. Plain rings store metal
                                    as TWO metafields — carat and metal_colour —
                                    and Platinum has no carat at all.
    A step whose param begins `fye_` is CARRIED, not filtered: it stays out of
    the filter URL and travels with the enquiry instead. Ed, 14/08/2026 and
    03/09/2026: metal is asked on every journey but only the plain collection
    can filter on it.
  · Every step ends with "I'm flexible" (empty value, no param). That rule is
    what guarantees no ring is orphaned. Do not remove it.
  · The heading is deliberately absent from the preset: page.find-your-ring
    already carries "Find Your Ring" in its banner, and two titles a screen
    apart read as a mistake. The settings remain for other uses.
  · Without JavaScript each journey card is a plain link to its collection and
    the enquiry form still posts.

  The filters are LIVE and verified (Ed, 03/09/2026): all 12 `filters.*`
  metafields are switched on in Search & Discovery, and
  Concave + 4mm + 18ct Rose Gold returns exactly 3. The visible sidebar on the
  collection page is still xCloud's and will not show these filters as ticked.

  Icons are SVG files in Content › Files, so they come in as text filenames
  resolved with `file_url` — see fye-shape-tiles for why not image_picker.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign band = s.band | default: 'ivory'
  assign flex_label = s.flexible_label | default: "I'm flexible"
  assign journeys = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'journey'
  assign steps = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'step'
-%}

<section class="rfd band band--{{ band }}" data-screen-label="Ring finder" data-fye-finder>
  <div class="wrap rfd__wrap">

    {%- if s.eyebrow != blank or s.heading != blank or s.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="sect-head rfd__head">
        {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.heading != blank -%}<h2>{{ s.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.intro != blank -%}<p class="lead">{{ s.intro }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="rfd__bar">
      <button type="button" class="rfd__back" data-fye-finder-back hidden>Back</button>
      <p class="rfd__progress eyebrow" data-fye-finder-progress hidden></p>
    </div>

    <div class="rfd__stage">

      <div class="rfd__panel" data-fye-finder-panel="journeys">
        {%- if s.journeys_q != blank -%}
          <h3 class="rfd__q">{{ s.journeys_q }}</h3>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if journeys.size > 0 -%}
          <ul class="rfd__journeys">
            {%- for block in journeys -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign b = block.settings
                assign coll = b.collection
                assign jkey = b.key | default: coll.handle
              -%}
              <li class="rfd__jitem" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <a class="rfd__journey" href="{{ coll.url | default: '/collections/all' }}"
                   data-fye-finder-journey="{{ jkey }}"
                   data-fye-finder-collection="{{ coll.url | default: '/collections/all' }}"
                   data-fye-finder-label="{{ b.label | default: coll.title | escape }}">
                  {%- if b.icon != blank -%}
                    <img class="rfd__jicon" src="{{ b.icon | file_url }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="68" height="68" loading="lazy">
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <span class="rfd__jname">{{ b.label | default: coll.title }}</span>
                  {%- if b.description != blank -%}
                    <span class="rfd__jdesc">{{ b.description }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="lead">Add a journey block for each collection the finder should search.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- for block in steps -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign b = block.settings
          assign cols = b.columns | default: '3'
          assign lines = b.options | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
        -%}
        <fieldset class="rfd__panel rfd__step" hidden
                  data-fye-finder-step
                  data-fye-finder-journey="{{ b.journey }}"
                  data-fye-finder-param="{{ b.param }}"
                  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <legend class="rfd__q" tabindex="-1" data-fye-finder-question>{{ b.heading | default: 'Choose an option' }}</legend>
          {%- if b.hint != blank -%}<p class="rfd__hint">{{ b.hint }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="rfd__opts" style="--cols: {{ cols }};">
            {%- for line in lines -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign row = line | strip
                if row == blank
                  continue
                endif
                assign parts = row | split: '|'
                assign lbl = parts[0] | strip
                assign val = parts[1] | strip | default: lbl
                assign ico = parts[2] | strip
              -%}
              <button type="button" class="rfd__opt"
                      data-fye-finder-option
                      data-fye-finder-value="{{ val | escape }}"
                      data-fye-finder-label="{{ lbl | escape }}">
                {%- if ico != blank -%}
                  <img class="rfd__oicon" src="{{ ico | file_url }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy">
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="rfd__olabel">{{ lbl }}</span>
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
            <button type="button" class="rfd__opt rfd__opt--flex"
                    data-fye-finder-option
                    data-fye-finder-value=""
                    data-fye-finder-label="{{ flex_label | escape }}">
              <span class="rfd__olabel">{{ flex_label }}</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      {%- endfor -%}

      <div class="rfd__panel rfd__results" hidden data-fye-finder-panel="results">

        <div class="rfd__rhead">
          <h3 class="rfd__q" tabindex="-1" data-fye-finder-question>{{ s.results_heading | default: 'Rings that match' }}</h3>
          <p class="rfd__chips" data-fye-finder-chips></p>
        </div>

        <p class="rfd__count" data-fye-finder-count aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="rfd__grid" data-fye-finder-grid></div>

        <div class="rfd__ractions">
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/collections/all" data-fye-finder-results hidden>{{ s.results_label | default: 'See all matching rings' }}</a>
          <button type="button" class="rfd__restart" data-fye-finder-restart>Start again</button>
        </div>

        <aside class="rfd__custom" data-fye-finder-custom>
          <h3 class="rfd__ctitle">{{ s.custom_heading | default: "Can't see what you're looking for?" }}</h3>
          <p class="rfd__hint">{{ s.custom_intro | default: "Enter your details here and we'll contact you with custom options." }}</p>
          {%- form 'contact', class: 'rfd__form', id: 'rfd-enquiry' -%}
            {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
              <p class="rfd__thanks">{{ s.custom_thanks | default: "Thank you. We'll be in touch shortly with options made for you." }}</p>
            {%- else -%}
              {%- if form.errors -%}
                <p class="rfd__error">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <div class="rfd__fields">
                <p class="rfd__field">
                  <label for="rfd-name">Name</label>
                  <input type="text" id="rfd-name" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" required>
                </p>
                <p class="rfd__field">
                  <label for="rfd-email">Email</label>
                  <input type="email" id="rfd-email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required>
                </p>
                <p class="rfd__field">
                  <label for="rfd-phone">Telephone <span class="rfd__opt-note">optional</span></label>
                  <input type="tel" id="rfd-phone" name="contact[phone]" autocomplete="tel">
                </p>
                <p class="rfd__field rfd__field--wide">
                  <label for="rfd-body">What are you looking for?</label>
                  <textarea id="rfd-body" name="contact[body]" rows="3" placeholder="{{ s.custom_placeholder | default: 'Anything you would like us to know — a stone, a budget, a date.' | escape }}"></textarea>
                </p>
              </div>
              <input type="hidden" name="contact[Ring finder]" value="" data-fye-finder-answers-field>
              <button type="submit" class="btn">{{ s.custom_label | default: 'Send my details' }}</button>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endform -%}
        </aside>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .rfd__wrap { max-width: var(--maxw-narrow); }
.fye .rfd__head { margin-bottom: var(--s6); }

/* Back + progress share one row so the stage below never moves when the
   back button appears. min-height holds the row when both are hidden. */
.fye .rfd__bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--s4);
  min-height: 44px;
  margin-bottom: var(--s3);
}
.fye .rfd__progress { margin: 0; margin-left: auto; }
.fye .rfd__back {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: none;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__back:hover { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .rfd__back[hidden], .fye .rfd__progress[hidden] { display: none; }

.fye .rfd__panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s5); }
.fye .rfd__panel[hidden] { display: none; }
.fye .rfd__step { margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; min-width: 0; }

/* The question. Display face at the h3 size, sentence case: it is a question
   put to one person, not a section title. */
.fye .rfd__q {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h3);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  line-height: var(--lh-heading);
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.fye .rfd__q:focus { outline: none; }
.fye .rfd__hint { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* --- journeys ------------------------------------------------------------ */
.fye .rfd__journeys {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--grid-gap);
}
.fye .rfd__jitem { margin: 0; display: flex; }
.fye .rfd__journey {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--s3);
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: var(--s5);
  border: var(--hairline);
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__journey:hover { border-color: var(--sage); color: var(--ink); }
.fye .rfd__journey:hover .rfd__jname { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .rfd__jicon { width: 68px; height: 68px; }
.fye .rfd__jname {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__jdesc { font-size: var(--fs-small); line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* --- options ------------------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .rfd__opts {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols, 3), minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--s3);
}
/* A tile, not a button: white ground, hairline, the label in body type. The
   hover shifts the edge and the words to sage, like every other control. */
.fye .rfd__opt {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--s2);
  min-height: 56px;
  padding: var(--s4);
  border: var(--hairline);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
  font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
  line-height: 1.35;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__opt:hover { border-color: var(--sage); color: var(--sage); }
.fye .rfd__opt:active { border-color: var(--sage-deep); color: var(--sage-deep); }
.fye .rfd__oicon { width: 56px; height: 56px; }
/* Icons are teal line-art; a hover recolour would need a mask. Fading them a
   step is the honest equivalent. */
.fye .rfd__opt:hover .rfd__oicon { opacity: 0.7; }
.fye .rfd__opt--flex {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  background: transparent;
  font-weight: var(--fw-light);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

/* --- results ------------------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .rfd__results { gap: var(--s5); }
.fye .rfd__rhead { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s2); }
/* The answers as one quiet line under the heading, not a definition list:
   at this point in the journey they are context, not the subject. */
.fye .rfd__chips { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .rfd__count {
  margin: 0;
  padding-bottom: var(--s3);
  border-bottom: var(--hairline);
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}
.fye .rfd__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--grid-gap);
}
.fye .rfd__grid > :where(div) { display: contents; }
.fye .rfd-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--s2);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd-card:hover { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .rfd-card__media {
  display: block;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  background: var(--white);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.fye .rfd-card__media :where(img) { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
.fye .rfd-card__title { font-size: var(--fs-small); line-height: 1.4; }
.fye .rfd-card__price { font-size: var(--fs-small); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .rfd__ractions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--s5); }
.fye .rfd__restart {
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: none;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__restart:hover { color: var(--sage); }

/* --- custom enquiry ------------------------------------------------------ */
.fye .rfd__custom {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--s3);
  padding: var(--s5);
  border: var(--hairline);
  background: var(--white);
}
.fye .rfd__ctitle {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
  font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.fye .rfd__form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s4); margin: 0; }
.fye .rfd__fields {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--s3);
}
.fye .rfd__field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s1); margin: 0; }
.fye .rfd__field--wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.fye .rfd__field :where(label) {
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}
.fye .rfd__opt-note { font-weight: var(--fw-light); letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
.fye .rfd__field :where(input, textarea) {
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: var(--s2) var(--s3);
  border: var(--hairline);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
  font-weight: var(--fw-light);
  transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .rfd__field :where(textarea) { min-height: 88px; resize: vertical; }
.fye .rfd__field :where(input:focus, textarea:focus) { border-color: var(--sage); outline: none; }
.fye .rfd__form :where(.btn) { align-self: flex-start; }
.fye .rfd__thanks, .fye .rfd__error { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); }
.fye .rfd__error { color: var(--sage-deep); }

/* --- breakpoints, last --------------------------------------------------- */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fye .rfd__opts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .fye .rfd__fields { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fye .rfd__journeys { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .fye .rfd__opts { gap: var(--s2); }
  .fye .rfd__opt { padding: var(--s3); }
  .fye .rfd__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .fye .rfd__fields { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .fye .rfd__custom { padding: var(--s4); }
  .fye .rfd__ractions { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s3); }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Ring finder",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "fye-ring-finder",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Leave the heading empty when the page banner already names the page." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Introduction" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "journeys_q", "label": "First question", "default": "What are you looking for?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "flexible_label", "label": "Skip option label", "default": "I'm flexible", "info": "Ends every step and applies no filter. Keep it: it is what makes every ring reachable." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Results" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "results_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Rings that match" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "results_label", "label": "Collection link", "default": "See all matching rings" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Custom options enquiry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "custom_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Can't see what you're looking for?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "custom_intro", "label": "Introduction", "default": "Enter your details here and we'll contact you with custom options." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "custom_placeholder", "label": "Message placeholder", "default": "Anything you would like us to know — a stone, a budget, a date." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "custom_label", "label": "Button", "default": "Send my details" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "custom_thanks", "label": "Thank you message", "default": "Thank you. We'll be in touch shortly with options made for you." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Background" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "band", "label": "Background", "default": "ivory",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Champagne ivory" },
        { "value": "mist", "label": "Mist blue" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "journey",
      "name": "Journey",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "key", "label": "Key", "info": "Short word that its steps repeat, e.g. plain. Defaults to the collection handle." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Name" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "description", "label": "Description" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon file name", "info": "A file in Content › Files, including the extension. SVG allowed." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Step",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "journey", "label": "Journey key", "info": "Must match a journey block's key." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Question" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "hint", "label": "Hint" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "param", "label": "Filter metafield key", "info": "A key in the filters namespace, e.g. profile. Begin with fye_ to carry the answer to the enquiry without filtering." },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "options", "label": "Options", "info": "One per line: Label | value | icon.svg. Value and icon are optional. Ranges as 1.00..1.49; two filters at once as carat=18ct&metal_colour=Rose Gold." },
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "columns", "label": "Columns", "default": "3",
          "options": [
            { "value": "2", "label": "Two" },
            { "value": "3", "label": "Three" },
            { "value": "4", "label": "Four" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 40,
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Ring finder", "blocks": [ { "type": "journey" }, { "type": "step" } ] }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
